  "$docs": {
    "status": "A hotel chain on the ACTZ network, and the first franchisee in this repo. It is a chain rather than a single property on purpose: `locations` is the branch list, so the same tenant folder describes one hotel or forty, and adding the next branch is one entry here rather than a new tenant. It ships `hq` (the chain's own console) and `lobby` (the unattended screen in each property's entrance). No guest app: a guest books in the network's traveller app, which the network already ships.",
    "tokens": "Every token here is an override of the network's, declared in `inheritance.overrides` so the inherited value and the chosen one stay distinguishable. A property that wants the network's look deletes an entry and inherits it back. All ten semantic pairs clear WCAG AA against both surfaces -- `packages/ui/src/contrast.test.ts` enforces that for every tenant in this tree.",
    "places": "Each branch names the property the way a person would, in `placeQuery`. `googlePlaceId` is absent until a lookup resolves it against the live Places API and confirms the listing is lodging -- an id typed in by hand that points at the cafe next door is a silent error, and the lobby screen would show the cafe's hours under the hotel's name."
  },
